{# templates/_theme_research_mount.html.j2 — the basket page's theme-research entry.

  Decides WHETHER a basket page mounts theme research, and emits the client
  assets once; `_theme_research_section.html.j2` decides what the section
  looks like. Neither file names a vertical: the builder passes
  `theme_research_mount`, the nine-key context that
  `engine.market_ontology.theme_research_mounts.mount_context_for_basket()`
  returns for this basket, or nothing at all (shared hook 2).

  Laws:
    L4 — `theme_research_mount` absent, not a mapping, or missing any of its
         nine keys → silent: no mount, no assets, no empty shell. A page that
         cannot say which vertical it is mounting mounts nothing. The section
         partial is included with `ignore missing` and its output is captured
         first, so a checkout without that file emits no orphan asset tag
         either — the incumbent page survives a missing vertical (L2).
    L5 — Mount shape, asset URLs and API paths are pinned from the reviewed
         f53c7c3845b3 lane (T10 part 1). Basket pages live under site/basket/,
         hence the `../assets/...` prefix; the section stays hidden until an
         entitled client response unhides it.
    L6 — Every visible string flows through the section's `t('en','zh')`.
    L7 — No analytical data, payload, figure, token or URL beyond the two
         declared asset paths and the two API paths.
#}
{% set _m = theme_research_mount %}
{% if _m is mapping %}
  {% set _ok = namespace(value=1) %}
  {% for _k in ['anchor_theme_id', 'slices', 'schema_id', 'evidence_schema_id',
                'slice_labels_json', 'title_en', 'title_zh', 'note_en', 'note_zh'] %}
    {% if not _m.get(_k) or _m.get(_k) is not string %}
      {% set _ok.value = 0 %}
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
  {% for _c in _m.get('anchor_theme_id') or '' %}
    {% if _c not in 'abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789_' %}
      {% set _ok.value = 0 %}
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
  {% if _ok.value == 1 %}
    {% set _section %}{% with tr_mount = _m %}{% include "_theme_research_section.html.j2" ignore missing %}{% endwith %}{% endset %}
    {% if _section.strip() %}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/css/theme-research.css">
{{ _section }}
<script defer src="../assets/js/theme-research.js?v=20260924b"></script>
    {% endif %}
  {% endif %}
{% endif %}
